oKY9rrLDjFfFgD6NjLyJk_DlmR_JQ&oe=6AD245CA"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "906442941985349", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_906442945318682_6301104449196415874_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j7pjKuVeD_UQ7kNvwFsPH1u&_nc_oc=Adogm63qAta_swCnRa65thNX0KwtiqyyIwX797cgZp_fq6O3H6mecq2wV0t7WzHekbI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNtm1cBWSp3KSCUcMII0s2sZB_FbL6AYyscadZ8oJNTlg&oe=6AD2446A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Prado Racing: Car Driving Simulator", "keywords": ["carracing", "cardriving", "drivingsimulator", "racinggame", "suvracing"], "long_description": "Welcome to Prado Racing: Car Driving Simulator, an action-packed racing experience where speed, precision, and skill decide the winner. Get behind the wheel of powerful Prado-inspired SUVs and compete in exciting races across highways, city streets, desert roads, and scenic environments.\n\nChallenge skilled AI racers, master realistic driving physics, and push your vehicle to its limits. Every race offers a new opportunity to prove your driving abilities as you dodge traffic, take perfect racing lines, and cross the finish line ahead of your opponents.\n\nUnlock new vehicles, improve your racing performance, and experience smooth controls designed for both casual and competitive players. Whether you enjoy fast-paced arcade racing or immersive driving simulation, Prado Racing: Car Driving Simulator delivers an exciting adventure from start to finish.\n\nGame Features\n\nHigh-speed Prado-inspired SUV racing\nRealistic driving physics and responsive controls\nMultiple race tracks and diverse environments\nChallenging AI opponents\nSmooth and immersive driving experience\nBeautiful 3D graphics and detailed vehicles\nMultiple camera views for the perfect race\nEasy-to-learn gameplay with rewarding progression\n\nStart your engine, accelerate to top speed, and dominate every race. Take on 